  = must: use docs/slices/P3_Compiled_SOP_Operator_Contracts_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the executable P3 final slice surface
  = must: execute P3-S01 before revising or superseding existing operator contract authority
  = must: execute P3-S02 before refreshing specific operator contracts
  = must: execute P3-S03 and P3-S04 before downstream P4 packetization, P5 LangGraph runtime, or P6 surface projection consumes P3 authority
  = must: preserve fixture oracle as a plan until a later source-preserved implementation activation opens fixture files
  = must: keep dependency installation, package metadata mutation, adapter work, transport work, UI work, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control unauthorized
  - never: treat this canonical specification as permission to write implementation code, create fixture files, install dependencies, mutate package metadata, dispatch work, control operations, or control the live machine

& [CanonicalP3FinalSliceSequence] is the accepted final slice sequence for P3
  + [slice] is P3-S01 boundary import and operator duty inventory
  + [slice] is P3-S02 common operator envelope and SOP-first refusal semantics
  + [slice] is P3-S03 signature validation operator contract refresh
  + [slice] is P3-S04 support readiness recompute operator contract refresh
  + [slice] is P3-S05 operator trace fixture oracle and no-automation boundary plan
  + [slice] is P3-S06 P3 completion review and downstream gate
  + [current_ready_slice] is P3-S01
  + [gated_slice] is P3-S02 until P3-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P3-S03 until P3-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P3-S04 until P3-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P3-S05 until P3-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is P3-S06 until P3-S05 accepted

  = must: preserve this order unless a completed-work review rebakes the P3 surface
  = must: mark downstream slices stale when an upstream P3 output changes

& [CanonicalP3ModelRouting] is the model routing for P3 final slices
  + [P3-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P3-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P3-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P3-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P3-S05] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after P3-S04 acceptance unless operator semantics or authority rules change
  + [P3-S06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep operator envelope semantics, SOP-first interrupts, authority mutation boundaries, trace identity, false-ready prevention, downstream gates, dispatch boundaries, and live-control boundaries under deeper reasoning
  = must: treat bounded fixture oracle planning as Spark-suitable only after common envelope and specific operator refreshes are accepted

